{"id":"vod_md_4275","vodId":"4275","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"笨女孩","name_cn":"笨女孩","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230905-1/17f40b44b84da71271bb2c5b5f254df0.jpg"},"summary":"花畑佳子（悠木碧 配音）是一个实实在在的笨蛋。不仅学习力为零，常常收获零分的考卷，在生活中，也是个完全不认路，总是莫名其妙惹出各种各样麻烦的问题人物。可是，佳子虽然脑袋笨，却拥有一颗闪闪发光的善良的内心。阿久津明（杉田智和 配音）和佳子刚好相反，他拥有绝顶聪明的头脑，却不擅长一切和运动有关的事情。是他一直陪伴在佳子身边，照顾着她的学习和生活。温柔迷糊的隅野沙耶香（原田彩枫 配音）是佳子唯一的也是最好的朋友，她的言行举止常常在不知不觉之中被佳子带歪。风纪委员长（上坂堇 配音）苦苦的暗恋着津明，佳子对于她来说，是情敌一般的存在。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-05 09:02:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/wDp2R8c8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/xnwDMa7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/GVHx9456/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/Ob1ucSOW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/FP5lRDMS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/4UFBBmga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/lhsN9sse/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/UjC0laGh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/IVvCRyme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/K2hpHm1Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/XZS8CTu4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/Z6IRhQcL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:06.972Z"}